<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Tàng Thư Các - Kho Tàng Tri Thức Lịch Sử</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --paper: #F4ECD8;
            --red: #7B1E1E;
            --red-dark: #581313;
            --gold: #D4AF37;
            --gold-light: #F7E8B5;
            --ink: #2C1E18;
            --card: #FFFDF8;
            --green: #2E6F40;
        }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        body {
            font-family: 'Noto Serif', 'Times New Roman', serif;
            background: var(--paper);
            color: var(--ink);
            line-height: 1.65;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(212,175,55,.14) 1px, transparent 0);
            background-size: 24px 24px;
        }
        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--red-dark), var(--red));
            color: var(--paper);
            border-bottom: 4px double var(--gold);
            padding: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px #2c1e184d;
        }
        .header-top {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto 18px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        .header-right {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        .btn-back, .progress, .btn-music {
            padding: 7px 14px;
            border: 1px solid var(--gold);
            border-radius: 6px;
            color: var(--gold-light);
            text-decoration: none;
            background: #fffdf81f;
            font: inherit;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }
        .btn-back:hover, .btn-music:hover {
            background: var(--gold);
            color: var(--ink);
        }
        .header-center {
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 850px;
            margin: auto;
        }
        .header h1 {
            font-size: clamp(21px, 4vw, 29px);
            color: var(--gold);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        .header p { margin: 8px 0 18px; }
        .search-wrap { position: relative; max-width: 620px; margin: auto; }
        .search {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 13px 18px;
            border: 2px solid var(--gold);
            border-radius: 28px;
            font: inherit;
            background: var(--card);
            color: var(--ink);
            outline: none;
        }
        main {
            max-width: 1050px;
            width: 100%;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 30px 16px 50px;
            flex: 1;
        }
        .grade-tabs {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }
        .tab, .toggle-all, .study {
            font: inherit;
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
            border-radius: 7px;
        }
        .tab {
            padding: 13px 8px;
            border: 2px solid #c8b996;
            background: #e8dec5;
            color: var(--ink);
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }
        .tab.active {
            background: var(--red);
            color: var(--gold-light);
            border-color: var(--gold);
            box-shadow: 0 5px 12px #7b1e1e44;
        }
        .tab small {
            display: block;
            font-weight: normal;
            font-size: 12px;
            margin-top: 2px;
        }
        .toolbar {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            color: var(--red);
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .toggle-all {
            padding: 7px 12px;
            border: 1px solid var(--red);
            background: transparent;
            color: var(--red);
        }
        .topic {
            background: var(--card);
            border: 1px solid #d5c5a1;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .topic-head {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 15px 18px;
            border: 0;
            text-align: left;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #7b1e1e12, #d4af3718);
            font: inherit;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--red);
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 10px;
        }
        .topic-list {
            display: none;
            list-style: none;
            border-top: 1px solid #e5d9bc;
        }
        .topic.open .topic-list { display: block; }
        .lesson {
            padding: 12px 18px;
            border-bottom: 1px dashed #e8dec5;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }
        .lesson:last-child { border: 0; }
        .lesson.done .lesson-name {
            color: var(--green);
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .study {
            padding: 7px 14px;
            border: 1px solid var(--gold);
            background: var(--red);
            color: var(--gold-light);
            white-space: nowrap;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }
        .study:hover {
            background: var(--red-dark);
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }
        .empty {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px;
            background: var(--card);
            border: 1px dashed var(--gold);
            border-radius: 8px;
        }
        /* MODAL CHI TIẾT BÀI HỌC */
        .modal {
            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;
            background: #140c08d9;
            display: none;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 16px;
            z-index: 100;
        }
        .modal.active { display: flex; }
        .modal-box {
            position: relative;
            width: min(880px, 100%);
            max-height: 90vh;
            overflow-y: auto;
            padding: 28px 26px;
            background: var(--paper);
            border: 3px solid var(--gold);
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
        }
        .close {
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            float: right;
            border: 1px solid var(--gold);
            border-radius: 50%;
            width: 36px;
            height: 36px;
            background: var(--red);
            color: var(--gold-light);
            font-size: 22px;
            cursor: pointer;
            z-index: 10;
        }
        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            background: #7b1e1e18;
            color: var(--red);
            border: 1px solid #7b1e1e33;
            border-radius: 15px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .modal h2 {
            margin: 10px 45px 16px 0;
            color: var(--red);
            font-size: clamp(20px, 3vw, 25px);
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--gold);
            padding-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .section {
            padding: 18px 20px;
            margin: 14px 0;
            background: var(--card);
            border: 1px solid #dfd2b5;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }
        .section h3 {
            color: var(--red);
            font-size: 17px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--gold);
            padding-left: 10px;
        }
        .lesson-content h4 {
            color: var(--red-dark);
            font-size: 16px;
            margin: 16px 0 8px;
            padding: 6px 10px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #d4af3726, transparent);
            border-left: 3px solid var(--red);
            border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;
        }
        .lesson-content h4:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
        .lesson-content ul {
            padding-left: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .lesson-content li {
            margin-bottom: 7px;
            text-align: justify;
        }
        .lesson-content b { color: #581313; }
        .lesson-content strong { color: #581313; font-weight: bold; }
        .table-responsive {
            width: 100%;
            overflow-x: auto;
            margin: 14px 0 16px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(44, 30, 24, 0.08);
        }
        .history-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            font-size: 13.5px;
            background: #fff;
            border: 1.5px solid var(--gold);
        }
        .history-table thead th {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--red-dark), var(--red));
            color: var(--gold-light);
            font-weight: bold;
            padding: 10px 12px;
            border: 1px solid var(--gold);
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 14px;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }
        .history-table tbody td {
            padding: 9px 12px;
            border: 1px solid #dfd2b5;
            vertical-align: top;
            text-align: justify;
            line-height: 1.55;
            color: var(--ink);
        }
        .history-table tbody tr:nth-child(even) {
            background: #fbf6ec;
        }
        .history-table tbody tr:hover {
            background: #f7edd8;
        }
        .history-table strong {
            color: var(--red);
        }
        .key-term {
            background: #fff8e6;
            border: 1px dashed var(--gold);
            padding: 10px 14px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            margin: 8px 0;
        }
        .mindmap {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2c1e18, #4a2c22);
            color: var(--gold-light);
            padding: 18px;
            border: 1px solid var(--gold);
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .nodes {
            display: flex;
            gap: 8px;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin-top: 12px;
        }
        .node {
            padding: 7px 12px;
            border: 1px solid var(--gold);
            border-radius: 6px;
            background: #d4af372e;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .modal-actions {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: flex-end;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-top: 18px;
        }
        .modal-actions button {
            padding: 10px 18px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font: inherit;
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .done-btn {
            background: var(--green);
            border: 1px solid var(--gold);
            color: white;
        }
        .footer {
            padding: 18px;
            text-align: center;
            background: var(--ink);
            color: var(--gold);
            border-top: 3px solid var(--gold);
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .header h1 { font-size: 21px; }
            .lesson { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; }
            .study { width: 100%; }
            .grade-tabs { gap: 7px; }
            .tab { font-size: 14px; padding: 10px 4px; }
            .modal-box { padding: 18px 14px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="header">
    <div class="header-top">
        <a class="btn-back" href="trang-chinh.html">⬅ Quay lại Sảnh Chính</a>
        <div class="header-right">
            <button class="btn-music" id="btn-music" onclick="toggleMusic()">🎵 Nhạc nền: Đang bật</button>
            <div class="progress" id="progress">📜 Đã lĩnh hội: 0 / 43 bài học</div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="header-center">
        <h1>Tàng Thư Các - Kho Tàng Tri Thức Lịch Sử</h1>
        <p>Hệ thống hóa toàn diện Khái niệm, Kiến thức cốt lõi & Sự kiện trọng tâm Lịch sử THPT (Khối 10, 11, 12)</p>
        <div class="search-wrap">
            <input class="search" id="search" type="search" placeholder="Tìm tên bài học, khái niệm hoặc chủ đề (VD: Hiện thực lịch sử, Văn Lang, Đại Việt, ASEAN...)">
        </div>
    </div>
</header>

<main>
    <div class="grade-tabs" id="tabs"></div>
    <div class="toolbar">
        <span id="view-title"></span>
        <button class="toggle-all" id="toggle-all">↕ Mở rộng / Thu gọn tất cả</button>
    </div>
    <div id="topics"></div>
</main>

<!-- MODAL HIỂN THỊ NỘI DUNG CHI TIẾT TỪNG BÀI -->
<div class="modal" id="modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="modal-title">
    <div class="modal-box">
        <button class="close" id="close" aria-label="Đóng">×</button>
        <span class="badge" id="breadcrumb"></span>
        <h2 id="modal-title"></h2>
        <section class="section">
            <h3>📌 Hệ Thống Khái Niệm & Kiến Thức Cốt Lõi Cần Học Thuộc</h3>
            <div class="lesson-content" id="summary"></div>
        </section>
        <section class="mindmap">
            <h3>🧠 Sơ Đồ Tư Duy & Mạch Logic Bài Học</h3>
            <div class="nodes" id="nodes"></div>
        </section>
        <section class="section">
            <h3>🕊️ Góc Tư Duy & Giá Trị Hòa Bình</h3>
            <p id="reflection"></p>
        </section>
        <div class="modal-actions">
            <button id="mark-done" class="done-btn">✅ Đánh dấu Đã học</button>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<footer class="footer">
    <p><strong>Tàng Thư Các - Hệ Thống Học Tập Và Trải Nghiệm Lịch Sử</strong></p>
    <p>Tiến độ học tập và nhạc nền được lưu đồng bộ tự động trên trình duyệt này.</p>
</footer>

<!-- THẺ AUDIO ĐỒNG BỘ NHẠC NỀN -->
<audio id="bg-music" loop preload="auto">
    <source src="nhac-nen.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
